{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（24日）早上10時22分，太子西洋菜北街225號美邦大廈地下一間酒吧的男負責人，被職員發現手部受傷，浴血倒地；幸他清醒，由救護車送往明愛醫院救治。</p><p>現場可見，酒吧內地面遺有血跡。警方沒有檢獲遺書，但經調查後，相信姓胡（52歲）事主受金錢問題困擾，凌晨時返回酒吧以鎅刀尋短；案件列作「企圖自殺」跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638329624793088296814.jpeg/4wAXwVKF0fV5n5Yu20i_-RlRhGqRgP291RJJsNUSSbA\"/><figcaption>現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"酒吧地面遺下血跡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638332560936960019723.jpeg/4PtzGmwrc0xdrKvmw-MWx-KSCkg_4R4-Q-rixEPq4sQ\"/><figcaption>酒吧地面遺下血跡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638335304142848973152.jpeg/v69_hCajNNMyBfycWjCLFN4qhaDsfZj5hPlxvIT5cbw\"/><figcaption>現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190639385998004224651827.jpeg/5qV_JWXk2wmyIJ-B8EKZCWrXY8GmLozOJVcoJA9XKCQ\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:02:03.917356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:46:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:38:41.082734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:32.562449+00:00","content_hash":"7e950e2b545c610cb8dc41643fffa62db316da81b37e1fc8c662dbd1171e2991","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}